.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Starting the same Lennard-Jones fluid configuration well away from its target temperature, three runs compare how the instantaneous kinetic temperature evolves: an unthermostatted (NVE, microcanonical) run, where it simply stays wherever it started; the crude, deterministic VelocityRescalingThermostat, which snaps it back to the target at every rescaling; and the NoseHooverThermostat, which relaxes it smoothly toward the target via an extended-system friction variable.">

